    <description>Product hierarchy reference table. Only for IPS use. Contains &apos;many&apos; references to the &apos;one&apos; EPM ID in the Product master (OOTB Product object). Contains the flat structure for each unique path from root to leaf node for VPH &amp; VPLCH .</description>
